title: EvelynVentressClue0
---
During a particularly late night in college, Evelyn was studying in her dorm when she noticed hole in her wall. Located where the wall met the ceiling, the hole was unnaturally circular. She stood up on her chair and pressed herself against the wall. She looked inside to find a mess of wires. Tearing at the dry wall, Evelyn was able to pull at the wires until finding a small glossy mechanism. Pulling it out of the wall, she noticed a small lens on the inside. After reporting the camera to the RA, the university launched an investigation that turned up nothing. The feeling of eyes on her never left. She eventually requested a room change.
===

title: EvelynVentressClue1
---
Evelyn volunteered at a local hospital in high school in hopes of building a good college resume. The patients were sweet to her and always made light-hearted conversation when she popped in. One late night, Evelyn was delivering fruit cups to a variety of hospital main-stays when she heard a loud crashing noise from one of the rooms. With no other nurses around, she ran into the room to find nothing. The room looked empty from her angle. She slowly crept to the other side of the room to reveal a figure on the floor, hidden by the hospital bed. The arms of the figure bent backwards and its skin sagged off its skeleton. She quickly pressed the alarm for a nurse and Evelyn was ushered out of the room. The image of the mangled figure haunts her.
===

title: EvelynVentressClue2
---
When Evelyn was a small child, she used to dig through her mother’s old clothes in the attic. She would dance around with an old prom dress hanging off and following her around the room. Evelyn imagined she was a queen, dancing in front of her subjects at a luxurious ball. Her fantasy eventually died as her father’s voice cut through with an invitation to dinner. She quickly threw the dress off from over her school uniform and rushed downstairs. Her father met her at the bottom of the stairs and quickly ordered Evelyn to stop. He slowly came over to Evelyn and slapped her on the arm. Evelyn screamed and looked down at her arm to notice the mangled body of a spider bleeding on her arm.
===